        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Clara bought her first watercolour set at nineteen and painted brown puddles for a year. When someone finally showed her how much water to use, it took an afternoon.</p><p>She has painted wedding stationery and botanical prints for ten years and taught an evening class for six. Paper Garden is that class, filmed. This is sample text. Replace it with your own story.</p>"
