            "text": "Why the course exists"
          }
        },
        "heading_2": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Most tutorials show the painting, not the water"
          }
        },
        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Speed paintings look easy and teach very little. People in Clara's class kept asking the same things: why the colours turn to mud, why the edges go hard, why the greens look flat. The course answers those first.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
